#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:5
msgid "二重井戸ポテンシャル Part 2"
msgstr "Double-Well Potential, Part 2"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:7
msgid ""
"原子が協同して動くと、分極の向き、格子ひずみ、体積は二重井戸の深さにどう影響するでしょうか。\\ 今回の DFT 計算では、立方晶格子で "
":math:`[111]` 方向の井戸が :math:`[001]` 方向より深くなりました。\\ 正方晶ひずみを加えると "
":math:`[001]` 方向の井戸が深くなり、圧縮すると両方向の井戸が浅くなりました。"
msgstr ""
"When atoms move cooperatively, how do polarization direction, lattice "
"strain, and volume affect the well depth? \\  In these DFT calculations, "
"the well along :math:`[111]` was deeper than the one along :math:`[001]` "
"in a cubic lattice. \\  Applying tetragonal strain deepened the well "
"along :math:`[001]`, and compression made the wells in both directions "
"shallower."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:12
msgid "本計算例の目的"
msgstr "Objective of This Calculation Example"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:14
msgid ""
":doc:`Part 1 <total-energy-DFT-MLIP>` では Ti だけを動かしました。\\ ここでは 5 "
"原子の立方晶セルを出発点とし、Cohen–Krakauer が報告した極性ソフトモードに沿って Ba・Ti・O の相対位置を変えます "
":sup:`[3]`。\\ 構造を固定したまま各変位で全エネルギーを計算し、Cohen の電子構造の解釈 :sup:`[4]` "
"と照らし合わせます。"
msgstr ""
"In :doc:`Part 1 <total-energy-DFT-MLIP>`, we displaced only Ti. \\  Here "
"we start with a five-atom cubic cell and change the relative positions of"
" Ba, Ti, and O along the polar soft mode reported by Cohen–Krakauer "
":sup:`[3]`. \\  We calculate the total energy with the structure fixed at"
" each displacement and compare the results with Cohen's interpretation of"
" the electronic structure :sup:`[4]`."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:18
msgid ""
"計算では、Cohen–Krakauer が求めた協同的な Ba–Ti–O 変位を\\ :math:`[001]` および "
":math:`[111]` 方向へ適用し、次の点を検証します。"
msgstr ""
"We apply the cooperative Ba–Ti–O displacement pattern obtained by "
"Cohen–Krakauer along \\  :math:`[001]` and :math:`[111]` to examine the "
"following questions."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:21
msgid "立方晶 :math:`Q=0` が極性ソフトモードに対して不安定か。"
msgstr ""
"Is the cubic structure at :math:`Q=0` unstable with respect to the polar "
"soft mode?"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:22
msgid ""
"無ひずみ :math:`[001]`、無ひずみ :math:`[111]`、および\\ 正方晶ひずみ :math:`c/a=1.01` "
"の井戸深さがどのように異なるか。"
msgstr ""
"How do the well depths differ for unstrained :math:`[001]`, unstrained "
":math:`[111]`, and \\  tetragonal strain with :math:`c/a=1.01`?"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:24
msgid "体積を :math:`64.00` Å³ から :math:`62.57` Å³ へ圧縮したとき、\\ 強誘電的不安定性がどの程度抑制されるか。"
msgstr ""
"How much does compressing the volume from :math:`64.00` Å³ to "
":math:`62.57` Å³ \\  suppress the ferroelectric instability?"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:26
msgid "DOS/PDOS に現れる Ti :math:`3d`–O :math:`2p` 混成が、\\ 二重井戸ポテンシャルとどのように対応するか。"
msgstr ""
"How does Ti :math:`3d`–O :math:`2p` hybridization in the DOS/PDOS \\  "
"relate to the double-well potential?"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:29
msgid ""
"BaTiO₃ の強誘電性の背景には、局所電場の描像 :sup:`[1]` と\\ `ソフトモード <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/solid/soft_mode.html>`__\\ 理論 :sup:`[2]` があります。\\ "
"第一原理計算では、極性変位を促す長距離 Coulomb 相互作用と、立方晶を安定にする短距離の反発の競合から強誘電不安定性が生じ、\\ Ti "
":math:`3d`–O :math:`2p` 混成がこの短距離反発を弱めると説明されます :sup:`[4]`。\\ この機構は技術ノートの\\"
" `長距離のクーロン相互作用と短距離の反発 <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/solid/ferroelectric_origin.html#ferroelectric-"
"instability-origin>`__\\ で説明しています。\\ "
"ここでは、二重井戸の深さから、中心からずれた構造がどれだけ安定化するかを評価します。\\ "
"電子状態密度（DOS）と軌道に射影した状態密度（`PDOS <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/electronic/pdos.html>`__）から、Ti と O "
"の軌道成分がどのエネルギー範囲で重なるかを見ます。"
msgstr ""
"Two descriptions of ferroelectricity in BaTiO₃ are the local electric "
"field picture :sup:`[1]` and \\  `soft mode <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/solid/soft_mode.html>`__ \\  theory :sup:`[2]`. \\  "
"First-principles calculations attribute the ferroelectric instability to "
"competition between long-range Coulomb interactions that favor polar "
"displacements and short-range repulsion that stabilizes the cubic "
"structure. \\  In this picture, Ti :math:`3d`–O :math:`2p` hybridization "
"weakens the short-range repulsion :sup:`[4]`. \\  See \\  `long-range "
"Coulomb interactions and short-range repulsion <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/solid/ferroelectric_origin.html#ferroelectric-"
"instability-origin>`__ \\  in the Technical Notes for this mechanism. \\"
"  Here we use the well depth to evaluate how much the off-center "
"structure is stabilized. \\  The density of states (DOS) and the "
"projected density of states (`PDOS <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/electronic/pdos.html>`__) for individual orbitals show "
"the energy range over which the Ti and O orbital contributions overlap."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:40
msgid "計算モデルと解析方法"
msgstr "Calculation Models and Analysis Methods"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:43
msgid "ソフトモード座標"
msgstr "Soft-Mode Coordinate"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:45
msgid ""
"Cohen–Krakauer は、立方晶 BaTiO₃ の :math:`\\Gamma` 点において、\\ 約 :math:`-72\\ "
"\\mathrm{cm^{-1}}` の不安定な極性モードを報告しました :sup:`[3]`。\\ "
"負の符号は虚数振動数、すなわち立方晶構造のエネルギー曲率が負であることを表します\\ （技術ノートの\\ `虚数振動数と動的安定性 <https"
"://technical-notes.quemix.com/solid/phonon.html#imaginary-"
"frequency>`__）。\\ このモードの固有ベクトルに沿って原子を動かし、各変位で全エネルギーを計算します\\ （`frozen "
"phonon 法 <https://technical-notes.quemix.com/solid/soft_mode.html#frozen-"
"phonon>`__）。"
msgstr ""
"Cohen–Krakauer reported an unstable polar mode at the :math:`\\Gamma` "
"point of cubic BaTiO₃, \\  with a frequency of about :math:`-72\\ "
"\\mathrm{cm^{-1}}` :sup:`[3]`. \\  The negative sign denotes an imaginary"
" frequency and thus a negative energy curvature at the cubic structure \\"
"  (see \\  `imaginary frequencies and dynamical stability <https"
"://technical-notes.quemix.com/solid/phonon.html#imaginary-frequency>`__ "
"in the Technical Notes). \\  We move the atoms along the eigenvector of "
"this mode and calculate the total energy at each displacement \\  (the "
"`frozen phonon method <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/solid/soft_mode.html#frozen-phonon>`__)."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:52
msgid "O(2) 原子を固定し、Ti 変位を 1 とした公表固有ベクトルは"
msgstr ""
"Fixing O(2) and setting the Ti displacement to 1 gives the published "
"eigenvector below."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:54
#, python-brace-format
msgid "\\mathrm{Ba:Ti:O(1)}=0.53:1.00:-0.29"
msgstr "\\mathrm{Ba:Ti:O(1)}=0.53:1.00:-0.29"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:58
msgid ""
"です。実験的な正方晶変位パターン\\ :math:`0.53:1.00:-0.28` とよく一致しています :sup:`[3]`。\\ 本計算では"
" Ba を固定し、Ti の Ba に対する変位を :math:`Q` と定義します。\\ このとき、変位係数は"
msgstr ""
"This agrees well with the experimental tetragonal displacement pattern \\"
"  :math:`0.53:1.00:-0.28` :sup:`[3]`. \\  In our calculations we fix Ba "
"and define the displacement of Ti relative to Ba as :math:`Q`. \\  We "
"then obtain"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:63
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"C_{\\parallel}\n"
"=\\frac{-0.29-0.53}{1.00-0.53}\n"
"=-1.744680851,"
msgstr ""
"C_{\\parallel}\n"
"=\\frac{-0.29-0.53}{1.00-0.53}\n"
"=-1.744680851,"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:69
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"C_{\\perp}\n"
"=\\frac{0-0.53}{1.00-0.53}\n"
"=-1.127659574"
msgstr ""
"C_{\\perp}\n"
"=\\frac{0-0.53}{1.00-0.53}\n"
"=-1.127659574"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:75
msgid "となります。"
msgstr "for the displacement coefficients."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:77
msgid ":math:`[001]` 正方晶方向では、"
msgstr ""
"For the tetragonal :math:`[001]` direction, we use the following "
"displacements."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:79
msgid ""
"\\Delta z_{\\mathrm{Ba}} &= 0,\\\\\n"
"\\Delta z_{\\mathrm{Ti}} &= Q,\\\\\n"
"\\Delta z_{O_{\\parallel}} &= C_{\\parallel}Q,\\\\\n"
"\\Delta z_{O_{\\perp}} &= C_{\\perp}Q"
msgstr ""
"\\Delta z_{\\mathrm{Ba}} &= 0,\\\\\n"
"\\Delta z_{\\mathrm{Ti}} &= Q,\\\\\n"
"\\Delta z_{O_{\\parallel}} &= C_{\\parallel}Q,\\\\\n"
"\\Delta z_{O_{\\perp}} &= C_{\\perp}Q"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:86
msgid ""
"を用います。例えば :math:`Q=0.04` Å では、Ti は\\ :math:`+0.0400` Å、軸方向 O は "
":math:`-0.0698` Å、\\ 二つの垂直方向 O はそれぞれ :math:`-0.0451` Å 変位します。\\ "
"この協同変位により、一方の Ti–O 結合が短くなり、反対側が長くなります。"
msgstr ""
"For example, at :math:`Q=0.04` Å, Ti moves by \\  :math:`+0.0400` Å, the "
"axial O by :math:`-0.0698` Å, \\  and each of the two transverse O atoms "
"by :math:`-0.0451` Å. \\  This cooperative displacement shortens one Ti–O"
" bond and lengthens the bond on the opposite side."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:91
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":math:`[111]` 菱面体晶方向では、立方体の体対角線に沿って、3 つの軸方向の変位パターンを重ね合わせます。\\ 全 Ti "
"変位の大きさを :math:`Q`、各 Cartesian 成分を\\ :math:`d=Q/\\sqrt{3}` とすると、"
msgstr ""
"For the rhombohedral :math:`[111]` direction, we superpose the "
"displacement patterns for the three axes along the body diagonal of the "
"cube. \\  Let :math:`Q` be the magnitude of the total Ti displacement and"
" \\  :math:`d=Q/\\sqrt{3}` each Cartesian component. This gives the "
"displacements below."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:95
msgid "\\Delta\\mathbf r_{\\mathrm{Ti}}=(d,d,d),"
msgstr "\\Delta\\mathbf r_{\\mathrm{Ti}}=(d,d,d),"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:99
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\Delta\\mathbf r_{O_z}\n"
"=(C_{\\perp}d,C_{\\perp}d,C_{\\parallel}d),"
msgstr ""
"\\Delta\\mathbf r_{O_z}\n"
"=(C_{\\perp}d,C_{\\perp}d,C_{\\parallel}d),"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:104
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\Delta\\mathbf r_{O_y}\n"
"=(C_{\\perp}d,C_{\\parallel}d,C_{\\perp}d),"
msgstr ""
"\\Delta\\mathbf r_{O_y}\n"
"=(C_{\\perp}d,C_{\\parallel}d,C_{\\perp}d),"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:109
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\Delta\\mathbf r_{O_x}\n"
"=(C_{\\parallel}d,C_{\\perp}d,C_{\\perp}d)"
msgstr ""
"\\Delta\\mathbf r_{O_x}\n"
"=(C_{\\parallel}d,C_{\\perp}d,C_{\\perp}d)"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:114
msgid "となります。本計算で用いた入力値 :math:`\\delta` は Ti の各成分に加える値であるため、\\ 図の横軸に用いる実際の変位量は"
msgstr ""
"The input value :math:`\\delta` is added to each component of the Ti "
"position, \\  so we obtain the actual displacement for the horizontal "
"axis as follows."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:117
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Q=\\sqrt{3}\\,\\delta"
msgstr "Q=\\sqrt{3}\\,\\delta"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:121
msgid ""
"です。したがって、入力 :math:`\\delta=0.04` Å は\\ :math:`Q=0.069282` Å に対応します。\\ "
"この系列では、格子を立方晶に保ち、:math:`[111]` 型の内部変位を与えます。\\ "
"菱面体晶の格子角ひずみは含みません。Cohen–Krakauer は、菱面体晶の\\ "
"格子角ひずみが静的井戸深さへ与える影響は小さいことを示しています。"
msgstr ""
"Thus, an input of :math:`\\delta=0.04` Å corresponds to \\  "
":math:`Q=0.069282` Å. \\  This series keeps the lattice cubic and applies"
" an internal displacement pattern of the :math:`[111]` type. \\  It does "
"not include rhombohedral lattice-angle strain. Cohen–Krakauer showed that"
" this strain \\  has little effect on the static well depth."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:128
msgid "全エネルギーおよび DOS/PDOS"
msgstr "Total Energy and DOS/PDOS"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:130
msgid "基準構造は 5 原子立方晶 BaTiO₃ とし、理想分率座標を"
msgstr ""
"The ideal fractional coordinates below define our five-atom cubic BaTiO₃ "
"reference structure."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:132
msgid ""
"Ba  0.000000  0.000000  0.000000\n"
"Ti  0.500000  0.500000  0.500000\n"
"O1  0.500000  0.500000  0.000000\n"
"O2  0.500000  0.000000  0.500000\n"
"O3  0.000000  0.500000  0.500000"
msgstr ""
"Ba  0.000000  0.000000  0.000000\n"
"Ti  0.500000  0.500000  0.500000\n"
"O1  0.500000  0.500000  0.000000\n"
"O2  0.500000  0.000000  0.500000\n"
"O3  0.000000  0.500000  0.500000"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:140
msgid ""
"とします。各変位点ではセルと原子座標を固定し、OpenMX の\\ ``MD.Type Nomd`` による\\ `単点計算 <https"
"://technical-notes.quemix.com/electronic/structure_optimization.html"
"#structure-optimization>`__\\ を行います。比較するすべての点で、\\ "
"交換相関汎関数、擬ポテンシャル、PAO、エネルギーカットオフ、\\ :math:`k` 点メッシュ、電子温度、および SCF "
"収束条件を統一します。\\ 本結果では、参照論文との整合性を重視して LDA/CA19、500 Ry、\\ "
":math:`8\\times8\\times8` :math:`k` 点を基本条件としました。"
msgstr ""
"At each displacement, we fix the cell and atomic coordinates and use the "
"OpenMX setting \\  ``MD.Type Nomd`` to run a \\  `single-point "
"calculation <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/electronic/structure_optimization.html#structure-"
"optimization>`__ \\  at that geometry. Across all points in the "
"comparison, we use the same \\  exchange-correlation functional, "
"pseudopotentials, PAOs, energy cutoff, \\  :math:`k`-point mesh, "
"electronic temperature, and SCF convergence criteria. \\  To keep the "
"calculations consistent with the reference paper, we used LDA/CA19, 500 "
"Ry, and a \\  :math:`8\\times8\\times8` :math:`k`-point mesh as the main "
"settings."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:147
msgid "各体積では、同じ体積の :math:`Q=0` を基準として"
msgstr ""
"At each volume, we take :math:`Q=0` at that same volume as the reference "
"in the following expression."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:149
msgid "\\Delta E(Q;V)=E(Q;V)-E(0;V)"
msgstr "\\Delta E(Q;V)=E(Q;V)-E(0;V)"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:153
msgid "を meV/f.u. 単位で評価します。異なる体積の絶対エネルギー差は、\\ その体積における局所的な強誘電不安定性とは区別する必要があります。"
msgstr ""
"We evaluate this difference in meV/f.u. Absolute energy differences "
"between volumes \\  must be distinguished from the local ferroelectric "
"instability at a given volume."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:156
msgid "DOS/PDOS は、次の三構造について比較します。"
msgstr "We compare the DOS/PDOS for the following three structures."

