msgid ":math:`Q=0.00` Å、:math:`c/a=1.00`"
msgstr ":math:`Q=0.00` Å, :math:`c/a=1.00`"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:159 ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:284
msgid ":math:`Q=0.04` Å、:math:`c/a=1.00`"
msgstr ":math:`Q=0.04` Å, :math:`c/a=1.00`"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:160 ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:288
msgid ":math:`Q=0.05` Å、:math:`c/a=1.01`"
msgstr ":math:`Q=0.05` Å, :math:`c/a=1.01`"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:162
msgid ""
"エネルギーは各構造の VBM を :math:`0` eV として整列し、 Gaussian 幅 :math:`\\sigma=0.08` eV "
"を用います （技術ノートの\\ `ガウス関数によるぼかし <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/electronic/pdos.html#dos-broadening>`__）。主な解析範囲は、 O "
":math:`2p` が支配的な占有価電子帯 :math:`-6\\le E-E_{\\mathrm{VBM}}\\le0` eV です。"
msgstr ""
"We align the energies by setting the VBM of each structure to :math:`0` "
"eV and use a Gaussian width of :math:`\\sigma=0.08` eV (see \\  `Gaussian"
" broadening <https://technical-notes.quemix.com/electronic/pdos.html#dos-"
"broadening>`__ in the Technical Notes). The analysis focuses on the "
"occupied valence band dominated by O :math:`2p`, at :math:`-6\\le "
"E-E_{\\mathrm{VBM}}\\le0` eV."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:172
msgid "計算結果と考察"
msgstr "Calculation Results and Discussion"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:175
