msgstr "Double Well, Directional Dependence, Strain, and Volume Effects"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:177
msgid "2 種類の体積での二重井戸。圧縮すると井戸が浅くなります。"
msgstr "Double wells at two volumes. Compression makes the wells shallower."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:182
msgid ""
"BaTiO₃ の :math:`[001]` および :math:`[111]` ソフトモードに沿った\\ 二重井戸ポテンシャル。 "
":math:`V=64.00` Å³ における無ひずみ・ひずみ系列と、\\ :math:`V=62.57` Å³ "
"における圧縮系列を比較します。横軸の 0 より左側は負の変位です。\\ 井戸の深さは、各系列の :math:`Q=0` "
"と極小のエネルギー差から読み取ります。"
msgstr ""
"Double-well potentials along the :math:`[001]` and :math:`[111]` soft "
"modes in BaTiO₃. \\  The figure compares the unstrained and strained "
"series at :math:`V=64.00` Å³ with the compressed series at \\  "
":math:`V=62.57` Å³. Displacements to the left of zero on the horizontal "
"axis are negative. \\  Read the well depth from the energy difference "
"between :math:`Q=0` and the minimum of each curve."

