msgid ""
":math:`V=64.00` Å³、:math:`c/a=1` の :math:`[001]` 系列で\\ 有限変位のエネルギーが "
":math:`Q=0` より低いため、立方晶は\\ 極性ソフトモード方向に不安定です。反転対称性により、\\ :math:`+Q` と "
":math:`-Q` は反対向きの分極を持つ等価な極小に対応します\\ （技術ノートの\\ `+Qと−Qの等価性と反転対称性 <https"
"://technical-notes.quemix.com/solid/soft_mode.html#sm-inversion-"
"equivalence>`__）。"
msgstr ""
"In the series at :math:`V=64.00` Å³ and :math:`c/a=1` for :math:`[001]`, "
"\\  finite displacements have lower energies than at :math:`Q=0`, so the "
"cubic structure is \\  unstable along the polar soft mode. By inversion "
"symmetry, \\  :math:`+Q` and :math:`-Q` correspond to equivalent minima "
"with opposite polarizations \\  (see \\  `equivalence of +Q and −Q and "
"inversion symmetry <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/solid/soft_mode.html#sm-inversion-equivalence>`__ in the"
" Technical Notes)."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:231
msgid ""
"無ひずみ条件では、:math:`[111]` の極小（:math:`-13.237` meV/f.u.）が\\ :math:`[001]` "
"の極小（:math:`-6.621` meV/f.u.）より低く、井戸は深くなります。\\ これは Cohen–Krakauer "
"が報告した方向依存性と一致します。\\ 一方、:math:`c/a=1.01` の正方晶ひずみを導入すると、\\ :math:`[001]` "
"の極小は :math:`-13.732` meV/f.u. まで下がり、井戸の深さは\\ 無ひずみ :math:`[111]` "
"井戸とほぼ同程度になります。\\ したがって、内部ソフトモード変位が不安定性を生み、\\ 正方晶ひずみが :math:`[001]` "
"状態を追加的に安定化すると解釈できます。"
msgstr ""
"Under unstrained conditions, the :math:`[111]` minimum (:math:`-13.237` "
"meV/f.u.) is lower than the \\  :math:`[001]` minimum (:math:`-6.621` "
"meV/f.u.), so its well is deeper. \\  This agrees with the directional "
"dependence reported by Cohen–Krakauer. \\  However, when tetragonal "
"strain with :math:`c/a=1.01` is applied, the \\  :math:`[001]` minimum "
"drops to :math:`-13.732` meV/f.u. and the well depth \\  becomes "
"comparable to that of the unstrained :math:`[111]` well. \\  This "
"suggests that the internal soft-mode displacement drives the instability "
"\\  and tetragonal strain further stabilizes the :math:`[001]` state."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:240
msgid ""
"体積を :math:`62.57` Å³ へ圧縮すると、両方向の井戸深さは\\ 約 :math:`1`–:math:`2` meV/f.u. "
"まで減少します。この結果は、\\ 強誘電不安定性が体積と圧力に極めて敏感であるという\\ Cohen–Krakauer "
"の結論を再現します。ただし、両系列に小さな負の井戸が残るため、\\ "
"本結果は「不安定性のほぼ完全な抑制」を示しますが、「完全な消失」を直接示すものではありません。"
msgstr ""
"Compressing the volume to :math:`62.57` Å³ reduces the well depth in both"
" directions \\  to about :math:`1`–:math:`2` meV/f.u. This reproduces \\"
"  the conclusion that ferroelectric instability is highly sensitive to "
"volume and pressure, \\  as reported by Cohen–Krakauer. However, both "
"series retain shallow wells below their zero-displacement energies, \\  "
"so the results show near-complete suppression of the instability but do "
"not directly establish its disappearance."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:249
