":math:`Q=0.00` Å、:math:`Q=0.04` Å、および :math:`Q=0.05` Å、:math:`c/a=1.01` の"
" BaTiO₃ に対する Gaussian total DOS と Ti :math:`3d` / O :math:`2p` PDOS。\\ "
"エネルギーは各構造の VBM を :math:`0` eV としています。"
msgstr ""
"For BaTiO₃ at :math:`Q=0.00` Å, :math:`Q=0.04` Å, and :math:`Q=0.05` Å "
"with :math:`c/a=1.01`, the plots show the Gaussian-broadened total DOS "
"and the Ti :math:`3d` / O :math:`2p` PDOS. \\  The energy is set to "
":math:`0` eV at the VBM of each structure."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:261
msgid ""
"三構造の価電子帯は主として O :math:`2p` から構成されますが、\\ 同じ :math:`-6`–:math:`0` eV 領域に有限の"
" Ti :math:`3d` 成分が存在します。\\ これは、占有価電子状態が純粋な O :math:`2p` 状態ではなく、Ti "
":math:`3d` の混じった混成状態であることを示します\\ （PDOS の重なりと混成の関係は技術ノートの\\ "
"`軌道の混成とスペクトルの重なり <https://technical-notes.quemix.com/electronic/pdos.html"
"#orbital-hybridization>`__）。\\ すなわち、Ti–O 混成は\\ 立方晶 :math:`Q=0` "
"ですでに存在し、強誘電変位は混成をゼロから生成するのではなく、\\ 短い Ti–O 結合と長い Ti–O 結合の間で非対称化します。"
msgstr ""
"In all three structures, the valence band consists mainly of O "
":math:`2p`, but \\  a finite contribution is present in the same energy "
"range of :math:`-6`–:math:`0` eV from Ti :math:`3d`. \\  This shows that "
"the occupied valence states contain a mixture of O :math:`2p` and Ti "
":math:`3d` components \\  (for the relation between PDOS overlap and "
"hybridization, see \\  `orbital hybridization and spectral overlap <https"
"://technical-notes.quemix.com/electronic/pdos.html#orbital-"
"hybridization>`__ in the Technical Notes). \\  Thus, Ti–O hybridization "
"is already present \\  in the cubic structure at :math:`Q=0`. "
"Ferroelectric displacement does not create hybridization from scratch. "
"Instead, it makes the hybridization asymmetric \\  between the short and "
"long Ti–O bonds."

