msgid ""
"占有 Ti :math:`3d` 重みと :math:`H_{pd}` は変位とひずみに伴ってわずかに増加し、\\ Ti :math:`3d`–O"
" :math:`2p` スペクトルの重なりが系統的に変化します。\\ ただし、これらは局在基底への射影量および DOS "
"形状の重なり指標であり、\\ 形式的な Ti :math:`d` 電子数や Hamiltonian の混成行列要素そのものではありません\\ "
"（技術ノートの\\ `非直交基底での射影 <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/electronic/pdos.html#pdos-nonorthogonal>`__）。\\ "
"また、各構造を独立に VBM 整列しているため、重心の低エネルギー側への移動は\\ "
"全エネルギーの分解としては読めません（`エネルギーの基準と価電子帯上端 <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/electronic/pdos.html#pdos-energy-alignment>`__）。"
msgstr ""
"The occupied Ti :math:`3d` weight and :math:`H_{pd}` increase slightly "
"with displacement and strain, \\  and the Ti :math:`3d`–O :math:`2p` "
"spectral overlap changes systematically. \\  These quantify projections "
"onto a localized basis and the overlap of DOS profiles, respectively, \\"
"  rather than the formal Ti :math:`d` electron count or the hybridization"
" matrix elements of the Hamiltonian \\  (see \\  `projection in a "
"nonorthogonal basis <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/electronic/pdos.html#pdos-nonorthogonal>`__ in the "
"Technical Notes). \\  As the spectra are aligned independently to each "
"structure's VBM, the shift of the centroid to lower energy \\  cannot be "
"interpreted as a decomposition of the total energy (see `energy reference"
" and the valence band maximum <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/electronic/pdos.html#pdos-energy-alignment>`__)."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:301
msgid ""
"Cohen 1992 の Figure 2(a) は、強誘電 PbTiO₃ と立方晶 PbTiO₃ を比較し、\\ 強誘電変位によって Ti "
":math:`3d`–O :math:`2p` 混成が増強され、\\ バンド固有値和が低下することを示しました。Figure 2(b) は、\\ "
"PbTiO₃ の実験構造を両方に用いて PbTiO₃ と BaTiO₃ を比較し、\\ A サイト元素の化学的違いを分離しています "
":sup:`[4]`。"
msgstr ""
"Figure 2(a) of Cohen (1992) compares ferroelectric and cubic PbTiO₃. \\  "
"It shows that ferroelectric displacement enhances Ti :math:`3d`–O "
":math:`2p` hybridization \\  and lowers the sum of the band eigenvalues. "
"Figure 2(b) compares \\  PbTiO₃ and BaTiO₃ using the experimental PbTiO₃ "
"structure for both, \\  isolating the chemical difference between the "
"A-site elements :sup:`[4]`."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:307
msgid ""
"PbTiO₃ では Pb :math:`6s`–O :math:`2p` 混成が大きな正方晶ひずみを安定化するのに対し、\\ BaTiO₃ では "
"Ba–O 相互作用はよりイオン的で、主要な共有結合成分は Ti :math:`3d`–O :math:`2p` です :sup:`[4]`。\\ "
"本計算は PbTiO₃ を含まないため Figure 2 の直接再現ではありませんが、\\ BaTiO₃ における Ti :math:`3d` と"
" O :math:`2p` の価電子帯重なりと、\\ 極性変位に伴う系統的な PDOS 変化を再現しています。"
msgstr ""
"In PbTiO₃, Pb :math:`6s`–O :math:`2p` hybridization stabilizes the large "
"tetragonal strain, whereas \\  in BaTiO₃ the Ba–O interaction is more "
"ionic and the main covalent contribution comes from Ti :math:`3d`–O "
":math:`2p` :sup:`[4]`. \\  Our calculations do not include PbTiO₃ and "
"therefore do not directly reproduce Figure 2. However, they do reproduce "
"\\  the valence-band overlap of Ti :math:`3d` and O :math:`2p` in BaTiO₃ "
"\\  and systematic changes in the PDOS with polar displacement."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:314
msgid "Ti 3d の除外試験と価電子密度に関する解釈"
msgstr "Test Excluding Ti 3d and Interpretation of the Valence Electron Density"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:316
msgid ""
"Cohen は、混成を含まないイオン模型（potential-induced-breathing モデル）と、Ti :math:`3d` "
"の寄与を抑えた LAPW 計算の二つの方法で、\\ Ti–O 混成を抑えると強誘電不安定性が消えることを示しました :sup:`[3]`, "
":sup:`[4]`。\\ この結果は、混成が短距離 Ti–O 反発を緩めて極性変位を安定にするという因果関係を支持します\\ （技術ノートの\\"
" `Ti 3d–O 2pの混成の役割 <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/solid/ferroelectric_origin.html#fo-hybridization>`__）。\\"
" 本計算では Ti :math:`3d` 除外試験を行っていないため、\\ この因果的証明は参照論文に基づきます。一方、二重井戸ポテンシャルと "
"DOS/PDOS は、\\ 同じ機構に整合する構造的・軌道的証拠を与えます。"
msgstr ""
"Cohen used two approaches, an ionic model without hybridization (the "
"potential-induced-breathing model) and an LAPW calculation with the Ti "
":math:`3d` contribution suppressed, \\  to show that suppressing Ti–O "
"hybridization removes the ferroelectric instability :sup:`[3]`, "
":sup:`[4]`. \\  This result supports a causal link in which hybridization"
" weakens short-range Ti–O repulsion and stabilizes polar displacements \\"
"  (see \\  `role of Ti 3d–O 2p hybridization <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/solid/ferroelectric_origin.html#fo-hybridization>`__ in "
"the Technical Notes). \\  We did not perform the test excluding Ti "
":math:`3d`, \\  so this causal evidence comes from the cited studies. The"
" double-well potential and DOS/PDOS, by contrast, \\  provide structural "
"and orbital evidence consistent with the same mechanism."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:324
msgid ""
"現在の Quloud 計算例では価電子密度出力を利用できません。\\ したがって、以下は本計算の直接結果ではなく、Cohen–Krakauer "
"の\\ 実空間解析から予想される挙動です。"
msgstr ""
"Valence electron density output is unavailable for this Quloud "
"calculation example. \\  The following behavior is therefore expected "
"from Cohen–Krakauer's \\  real-space analysis. It was not obtained "
"directly from our calculations."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:328
msgid "Ba 周囲の価電子密度変形は小さいです。"
msgstr "The valence electron density changes little around Ba."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:329
msgid "Ti 周囲には O :math:`2p`–Ti :math:`3d` 混成に由来する価電子密度が現れます。"
msgstr ""
"Valence electron density due to O :math:`2p`–Ti :math:`3d` hybridization "
"appears around Ti."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:330
msgid "強誘電変位の増加に伴い、短い Ti–O 結合上で結合電荷が増加します。"
msgstr ""
"As the ferroelectric displacement increases, the bond charge increases "
"along the short Ti–O bond."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:331
msgid "長い Ti–O 結合側では結合電荷が相対的に減少し、Ti 周囲に双極子的な密度変形が生じます。"
msgstr ""
"The bond charge decreases in relative terms on the longer Ti–O side, "
"producing a dipole-like redistribution of electron density around Ti."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:332
msgid "軸方向 O と垂直方向 O の電子状態が非等価になります。"
msgstr ""
"The electronic states of the axial and transverse O atoms become "
"inequivalent."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:334
msgid ""
"この期待される実空間像は、本計算で観測された Ti :math:`3d` と\\ O :math:`2p` の占有価電子帯重なり、および変位に伴う"
" PDOS の系統的変化と整合します。\\ ただし、静的な価電子密度差だけから Born 有効電荷や動的分極を直接決定することはできず、\\ "
"その評価には Berry-phase 分極、線形応答、または対応する有限変位解析が必要です\\ （技術ノートの\\ `周期結晶の分極 <https"
"://technical-notes.quemix.com/solid/polarization.html>`__）。"
msgstr ""
"This expected real-space picture agrees with the occupied valence-band "
"overlap of Ti :math:`3d` and \\  O :math:`2p` observed in our "
"calculations and the systematic changes in PDOS with displacement. \\  "
"Static valence electron density differences alone, however, do not "
"directly determine Born effective charges or dynamical polarization. \\  "
"Evaluating them requires Berry-phase polarization, linear response, or a "
"corresponding finite-displacement analysis \\  (see \\  `polarization in "
"periodic crystals <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/solid/polarization.html>`__ in the Technical Notes)."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:342
msgid "有限温度 MD 計算への接続"
msgstr "Connection to Finite-Temperature MD Calculations"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:344
msgid ""
"本計算で得られる二重井戸ポテンシャルは、0 K における局所的な\\ ポテンシャルエネルギー面です。有限温度相転移では、局所井戸に加えて、\\ "
"セル間の分極相関、格子ひずみ、エントロピー、および熱揺らぎを考慮する必要があります。\\ "
"井戸の深さだけでは、相転移が変位型か秩序–無秩序型かも決まりません\\ （技術ノートの\\ `変位型と秩序–無秩序型の相転移 <https"
"://technical-notes.quemix.com/solid/soft_mode.html#displacive-order-"
"disorder>`__）。\\ 次の :doc:`構造相転移 <phase_transition>` では、Ti "
"の局所変位分布と格子定数が温度とともにどう変わるかを調べます。\\ :math:`[111]` 型の局所変位が高温立方晶でも残るか、静的 DFT "
"の井戸深さと MD の温度依存構造が整合するかが、\\ 二つの計算をつなぐ点です。\\ 静的 DFT "
"は「なぜ局所的な極性不安定性が存在するか」を示し、\\ 有限温度 MD "
"は「その局所不安定性が温度下でどのように秩序化・無秩序化するか」を示します。"
msgstr ""
"The double-well potential from this calculation is a local \\  potential "
"energy surface at 0 K. For finite-temperature phase transitions, besides "
"the local wells, \\  intercell polarization correlations, lattice strain,"
" entropy, and thermal fluctuations must be considered. \\  Well depth "
"alone also cannot determine whether the transition is displacive or "
"order–disorder \\  (see \\  `displacive and order–disorder phase "
"transitions <https://technical-notes.quemix.com/solid/soft_mode.html"
"#displacive-order-disorder>`__ in the Technical Notes). \\  The next "
"article, :doc:`Structural Phase Transitions <phase_transition>`, examines"
" how the local Ti displacement distribution and the lattice constants "
"change with temperature. The two calculations are linked by two "
"questions. Do \\  :math:`[111]`-type local displacements persist in the "
"high-temperature cubic phase? \\  Are the static DFT well depths "
"consistent with the temperature-dependent structures from MD? \\  Static "
"DFT shows why the local polar instability exists, \\  and finite-"
"temperature MD shows how that instability leads to ordering and "
"disordering at finite temperatures."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:357
msgid "まとめ"
msgstr "Summary"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:359
msgid ""
"本 OpenMX/Quloud 計算は、Cohen–Krakauer の極性ソフトモードを用いて、\\ BaTiO₃ "
"の強誘電不安定性を構造と電子状態の両面から再現しました。"
msgstr ""
"Using the polar soft mode of Cohen–Krakauer, our OpenMX/Quloud "
"calculations reproduced \\  the ferroelectric instability of BaTiO₃ in "
"both the structure and the electronic states."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:362
msgid ""
"Cohen–Krakauer が報告した不安定モードの振動数は約 :math:`-72\\ \\mathrm{cm^{-1}}` で、変位比は\\"
" :math:`\\mathrm{Ba:Ti:O(1)}=0.53:1.00:-0.29` です。"
msgstr ""
"Cohen–Krakauer reported an unstable mode with a frequency of about "
":math:`-72\\ \\mathrm{cm^{-1}}` and a displacement ratio of \\  "
":math:`\\mathrm{Ba:Ti:O(1)}=0.53:1.00:-0.29`."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:364
msgid ""
"同じソフトモードを :math:`[001]` と :math:`[111]` へ適用すると、\\ "
"それぞれ正方晶型と菱面体晶型の二重井戸ポテンシャルが得られます。"
msgstr ""
"Applying the same soft mode along :math:`[001]` and :math:`[111]` yields "
"\\  tetragonal-type and rhombohedral-type double-well potentials, "
"respectively."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:366
msgid ""
":math:`V=64.00` Å³ では、無ひずみ :math:`[111]` 井戸が\\ 無ひずみ :math:`[001]` "
"井戸より深いです。"
msgstr ""
"At :math:`V=64.00` Å³, the unstrained :math:`[111]` well is deeper \\  "
"than the unstrained :math:`[001]` well."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:368
msgid ""
":math:`c/a=1.01` の正方晶ひずみは :math:`[001]` 井戸を約 2 倍深くし、\\ :math:`[111]` "
"井戸とほぼ同程度に安定化します。"
msgstr ""
"Tetragonal strain with :math:`c/a=1.01` roughly doubles the depth of the "
":math:`[001]` well and brings the depth close to that of the \\  "
":math:`[111]` well."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:370
msgid ""
":math:`V=62.57` Å³ への圧縮は両井戸を約 :math:`1`–:math:`2` meV/f.u. まで浅くし、\\ "
"強い体積依存性を示します。"
msgstr ""
"Compression to :math:`V=62.57` Å³ reduces both well depths to about "
":math:`1`–:math:`2` meV/f.u., \\  showing a strong volume dependence."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:372
msgid ""
"DOS/PDOS では、O :math:`2p` 価電子帯内に有限の Ti :math:`3d` 成分が存在し、\\ "
"極性変位とひずみに伴ってそのスペクトル重なりが系統的に変化します。"
msgstr ""
"The DOS/PDOS shows that the O :math:`2p` valence band has a finite Ti "
":math:`3d` contribution, \\  with systematic changes in spectral overlap "
"as the polar displacement and strain vary."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:375
msgid "以上から、本結果は"
msgstr "Taken together, these results support Cohen's mechanism, shown below."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:377
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\text{極性ソフトモード}\n"
"\\;\\longrightarrow\\;\n"
"\\text{非対称な Ti–O 結合}\n"
"\\;\\longrightarrow\\;\n"
"\\mathrm{Ti}\\,3d\\text{–}\\mathrm O\\,2p\\text{ 混成の変化}\n"
"\\;\\longrightarrow\\;\n"
"\\text{短距離反発の緩和}\n"
"\\;\\longrightarrow\\;\n"
"\\text{二重井戸の形成}"
msgstr ""
"\\text{polar soft mode}\n"
"\\;\\longrightarrow\\;\n"
"\\text{asymmetric Ti–O bonds}\n"
"\\;\\longrightarrow\\;\n"
"\\mathrm{Ti}\\,3d\\text{–}\\mathrm O\\,2p\\text{ hybridization changes}\n"
"\\;\\longrightarrow\\;\n"
"\\text{weaker short-range repulsion}\n"
"\\;\\longrightarrow\\;\n"
"\\text{double well forms}"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy.rst:389
msgid ""
"という Cohen の機構を支持します。現在の計算は、構造的不安定性と軌道空間における\\ Ti–O 混成を示しています。一方、Ti "
":math:`3d` の直接除外試験と価電子密度の実空間可視化は\\ "
"未実施であり、その因果的・実空間的証拠は参照論文に基づくものとして明確に区別します。"
msgstr ""
"Our calculations show the structural instability and \\  Ti–O "
"hybridization in orbital space. However, we did not directly test the "
"effect of excluding Ti :math:`3d` or visualize the valence electron "
"density in real space. \\  The causal and real-space evidence for the "
"mechanism comes from the cited studies."

